          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 1v (second section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>&ldquo;...and I found [them] in Egypt.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&ldquo;...what] benefit do you have from the[m?&rdquo; ... &ldquo;... ]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the books of magic which [...]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>with them, and whoever is sick &rdquo;. [ ... ]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&ldquo;And why do you dabble in magic and teach the world</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>evil teachings? Tell us, then,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>in truth&mdash;where did you get these books,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>or else we will kill you and not show you mercy.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>He answered and said to them: &ldquo;My masters, th[ese books ... ]&rdquo;</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
